ings. The resulting valuation of £238k (Base Equity Value) reflects a fair market price for a stable, localized service provider. The primary negotiation hurdle will be the seller's likely anchoring to revenue or gross cash extraction, which exceeds the business's institutionalized earning power."},"deal_structure":{"expert":"deal_structure","company_name":"Greener Estates","analysis_date":"2024-05-22","score":62,"confidence":"high","structures":[{"name":"Conservative","strategy":"Maximum buyer protection via high deferment and performance-linked earnouts to mitigate extreme owner dependency and debtor risks.","suitable_when":"The buyer is concerned about the 7x debtor spike and the 'management gap' left by the departing founders.","consideration":{"total_headline":238000,"upfront_cash":95200,"upfront_percent":40,"deferred":47600,"deferred_schedule":"Paid in two equal installments at month 12 and month 24 post-completion.","earnout_maximum":95200,"earnout_metric":"EBITDA Maintenance","earnout_period_months":24,"earnout_rationale":"Protects against the loss of key grounds maintenance contracts managed personally by David Greener.","retention_escrow":21768,"escrow_release_conditions":"Released only upon successful collection of the £43,537 debtor balance identified in 2025 accounts."},"seller_obligations":{"handover_period_months":12,"non_compete_months":36,"non_compete_scope":"Grounds maintenance and facilities management within a 50-mile radius of current operations.","consultancy_arrangement":"David Greener to remain as a consultant for 12 months at a fixed fee to transition client relationships."},"warranties_indemnities":{"specific_indemnities":["Full indemnity for any bad debt write-offs exceeding £5,000 from the 2025 ledger.","Indemnity for any undisclosed tax liabilities arising from aggressive pension contributions."],"warranty_cap_percent":50,"warranty_period_months":24,"de_minimis":2500,"basket":7500},"completion_mechanism":{"type":"completion_accounts","wo