 grown from £920k to £2.2m in just two years, while operating profit has nearly quadrupled, demonstrating excellent control over administrative overheads. The shift in operating margin from 13.7% to 21.2% suggests that the company's fixed cost base is being efficiently leveraged as it scales. From an earnings quality perspective, EBITDA is growing in line with operating profit, and the business maintains a high degree of liquidity with a current ratio of 2.57 and substantial cash reserves. However, the quality of the balance sheet requires closer inspection; specifically, the 77.6% spike in trade debtors in 2025 warrants a detailed aged-debt analysis to ensure revenue is converting to cash. Furthermore, the extreme reliance on three major clients (84.3% of revenue) is the primary risk factor for a buyer, as the loss of a single contract would severely impair the company's ability to service debt. Provided the client contracts are long-term and the debtor spike is timing-related, the company represents a high-performing acquisition target with significant capacity for additional debt."}}	{"balanceSheet":{"id":96,"financialPeriodId":124,"targetCompanyId":29,"intangibleAssets":null,"tangibleFixedAssets":null,"freeholdProperty":null,"leaseholdProperty":null,"plantMachinery":null,"fixturesFittings":null,"motorVehicles":null,"computerEquipment":null,"stockInventory":null,"tradeDebtors":"-41315","prepayments":null,"amountsOwedByDirectors":null,"amountsOwedByConnectedCompanies":null,"directorsCurrentAccount":null,"otherDebtors":"4975","cashAtBank":"128058","totalCurrentAssets":"91719","tradeCreditors":"1156","taxationSocialSecurity":"-16452","vatPayable":null,"corporationTaxDue":null,"bankLoansOverdraftCurrent":null,"hirePurchaseCurrent":null,"accruals":null,"amountsOwedToDirectors":null,"otherCreditors":"-15140","totalCurrentLiabilities":"-30436","bankLoansLongTerm":"-5679","hirePurchaseLongTerm":"-983","deferredTaxation":"-3904","otherLongTermDebt":null,"totalLongTermLiab