evenue, a replacement MD/General Manager mid-point benchmark is £57,500. Adjustment = £57,500 - £9,237.","confidence":"high","defensibility_score":9,"case_for_inclusion":"The current salary is artificially low for tax efficiency (dividends); a buyer must account for the true cost of management.","case_for_exclusion":"The seller might argue the business can be run by existing staff with only part-time oversight."},{"item":"Deferred Vehicle Maintenance/Replacement Provision","category":"deferred_maintenance","amount":10580,"recurrence":"recurring","year":2025,"justification":"The fleet (76% of asset cost) is aging with low recent investment (3.5% in 24m). A 10% provision of the vehicle cost (£105,802) is required to reflect a sustainable maintenance/replacement cycle.","confidence":"medium","defensibility_score":6,"case_for_inclusion":"Operational data flags a 'Capex Cliff' risk; current earnings are inflated by under-investing in the fleet.","case_for_exclusion":"The seller will argue that current depreciation charges already account for asset wear and tear."},{"item":"Bad Debt Provision - Knowledge Properties Ltd","category":"bad_debt_provision","amount":6737,"recurrence":"one_off","year":2025,"justification":"Aged debtors report shows £13,473 (42.7% of ledger) with one client in the 60-day bracket. A conservative 50% provision is prudent given the concentration risk.","confidence":"medium","defensibility_score":7,"case_for_inclusion":"High concentration in a single aged debtor represents a specific risk to the quality of the reported receivables and historical revenue.","case_for_exclusion":"The seller may provide evidence of subsequent payment or a long-standing history of slow but reliable payment from this specific client."}],"total_add_backs":15977,"total_deductions":65580,"adjusted_ebitda":{"conservative":181337,"base":197314,"optimistic":212979},"adjustment_summary":{"reported_ebitda":246917,"plus_add_backs":15977,"minus_deductions":65580,"equals_adjusted_ebi