V 0) suggests these are personal vehicles for the two directors.","confidence":"medium","defensibility_score":6,"case_for_inclusion":"A buyer would not typically fund high-end personal vehicles for former owners as a business expense.","case_for_exclusion":"The seller may claim these vehicles are used for client visits and sales activities essential to the business."}],"deductions":[{"item":"Replacement Management Cost (FD/GM)","category":"missing_management","amount":95000,"recurrence":"recurring","year":2025,"justification":"The business is highly owner-dependent; a buyer would need to hire at least one senior manager (GM or FD) to replace the operational functions of the two departing owners.","confidence":"high","defensibility_score":8,"case_for_inclusion":"The current profit is generated by owners working 'in' the business; a sustainable yield requires a professional management structure.","case_for_exclusion":"The seller may argue the existing staff are capable of stepping up without a high-cost external hire."},{"item":"Maintenance Capex Provision","category":"deferred_maintenance","amount":54612,"recurrence":"recurring","year":2025,"justification":"Negligible recent investment (0.3% additions) suggests the business is coasting on old equipment; a provision equal to depreciation is required to maintain the asset base.","confidence":"medium","defensibility_score":7,"case_for_inclusion":"The lack of recent capex indicates a 'maintenance cliff' that the buyer will have to fund shortly after acquisition.","case_for_exclusion":"The seller may argue the equipment is high-quality and requires minimal ongoing investment due to the shift toward customer-supplied materials."}],"total_add_backs":270652,"total_deductions":149612,"adjusted_ebitda":{"conservative":392471,"base":469245,"optimistic":549425},"adjustment_summary":{"reported_ebitda":348205,"plus_add_backs":270652,"minus_deductions":149612,"equals_adjusted_ebitda_base":469245},"director_salary_analysis":{"direct