sed nature prevent it from achieving mid-market multiples. The primary challenge in a transaction will be the 'valuation gap' created by the seller's likely focus on 2025's peak performance versus the buyer's need to de-risk the 90% client concentration. An earn-out over 24 months, tied to the retention of the top 5 clients, is the most probable mechanism to achieve a successful exit."},"deal_structure":{"expert":"deal_structure","company_name":"Greenspark Productions","analysis_date":"2025-05-24","score":62,"confidence":"high","structures":[{"name":"Conservative","strategy":"Minimize upfront risk by bridging the valuation gap through performance-contingent payments and a long-term handover.","suitable_when":"The buyer is highly concerned about the 90% client concentration and the 2024 liquidity crunch.","consideration":{"total_headline":1100000,"upfront_cash":550000,"upfront_percent":50,"deferred":200000,"deferred_schedule":"Two equal installments of £100,000 at month 12 and month 24 post-completion.","earnout_maximum":350000,"earnout_metric":"Gross Profit retention from Top 5 Clients","earnout_period_months":24,"earnout_rationale":"Trigger 1 (Customer Concentration): 90% of revenue is from existing clients. Trigger 3 (Owner Dependency): High reliance on directors for contract wins. Identified by Risk and Valuation experts.","retention_escrow":110000,"escrow_release_conditions":"Released after 18 months pending no warranty claims related to tax or undisclosed liabilities."},"seller_obligations":{"handover_period_months":12,"non_compete_months":36,"non_compete_scope":"Direct competition in AV hire and event production within the UK; non-solicitation of existing clients and staff.","consultancy_arrangement":"Directors to remain as consultants for months 13-24 on a part-time basis to ensure earnout targets are met."},"warranties_indemnities":{"specific_indemnities":["Deferred tax liability of £107,660","Potential bad debt from unprovisioned £181k trade debtors","Hire 