se-case adjusted EBITDA of £364k accounts for the normalisation of exceptional distribution costs and owner-related expenses. However, a buyer must be prepared for immediate capital expenditure to refresh aging IT and warehouse infrastructure. The business is a 'cash cow' with significant debt capacity, but future value will be unlocked through operational tightening rather than top-line growth alone."},"valuation":{"expert":"valuation","company_name":"Test Company","analysis_date":"2024-05-22","score":85,"confidence":"high","ebitda_multiple_valuation":{"adjusted_ebitda_base":364360,"sector_multiple_range":{"low":2,"mid":2.75,"high":3.5},"selected_multiple":2.75,"multiple_justification":"The business sits at the mid-point of the sector range. While it demonstrates exceptional margin stability (29.2%) and a diversified customer base (HHI 1042), these premiums are offset by the small revenue scale (£3.2M), significant payroll cost creep (doubled since 2020), and approaching capex requirements for ERP and racking systems.","premium_factors_applied":["Exceptional gross margin stability (29.2% over 5 years)","Highly diversified customer base (no customer > 10%)","Strong interest coverage (39.9x) and low gearing (8.8%)","Consistent organic revenue growth (3.12% CAGR)"],"discount_factors_applied":["Small revenue scale (<£5M)","Operational inefficiency (payroll % of revenue doubled)","Aging IT and warehouse infrastructure (Capex cliff)","Key-man dependency (2-person management team)"],"enterprise_value_range":{"conservative":573400,"base":1001990,"optimistic":1485260}},"ev_to_equity_bridge":{"enterprise_value_base":1001990,"plus_cash":234200,"minus_long_term_debt":65000,"minus_director_loans":0,"minus_bad_debt_provision":6000,"minus_working_capital_adjustment":0,"other_adjustments":[{"item":"Deferred Maintenance Provision","amount":63500,"description":"Immediate capex required for ERP and Racking replacement"}],"equity_value":{"conservative":683100,"base":1101690,"optimisti