tion_mechanism":{"type":"locked_box","working_capital_peg":1086752,"rationale":"Simplifies the closing process for the seller."},"effective_price":{"best_case":3000000,"expected_case":3000000,"worst_case":2700000}}],"recommended_structure":"Balanced","recommendation_rationale":"The Balanced structure is optimal because it addresses the valuation gap (sellers likely expect £3.5M+) by offering a solid upfront amount while using a small earnout to validate the premium 3.25x multiple. The business is high-quality and debt-free, so a heavy earnout (Conservative) might alienate the seller, but the customer concentration and tech-team reliance justify some contingent protection.","negotiation_priorities":["Verification of the £1.05M cash balance and its treatment as 'excess' vs 'working' capital.","Securing long-term contracts or 'key man' clauses for the 9-person tech team.","Confirming the 85% gross margin sustainability against potential wage inflation."],"deal_breaker_terms":["Loss of any of the Top 3 clients (Blackstone, M&G, Aberdeen) prior to completion.","Resignation of more than 2 members of the technical development team during due diligence.","Discovery of undisclosed director loans or intercompany liabilities."],"key_findings":["The business is exceptionally clean with no debt and high cash reserves.","Valuation is sensitive to the 3.25x multiple which is a premium for this scale.","Operational risk is concentrated in the tech team, not the owners.","Negative cash conversion cycle makes this an ideal 'buy and build' platform."],"narrative":"Team Test Co is a rare 'fortress' SME. With 85% margins and a negative cash conversion cycle, it is operationally elite. The primary challenge in structuring is the gap between the EBITDA-based Equity Value (£2.88M) and the seller's likely revenue-anchored expectations (£3.5M+). A Balanced structure offering ~70% upfront cash, supported by the company's own £1.05M cash pile, provides a compelling offer while protecting the buyer against the moderate risks of customer concentration and technical team attrition."},"financial":{"expert":"financial","company_name":"Team Test Co","analysis_date":"2024-05-22","score":92,"confidence":"high","yearly_metrics":{"2020":{"revenue":1245000,"revenue_yoy_growth_percent":null,"cost_of_sales":186750,"gross_profit":1058250,"gross_margin_percent":85,"administrative_expenses":752400,"operating_profit":218850,"operating_margin_percent":17.58,"depreciation_amortisation":28450,"ebitda":247300,"interest_payable":12400,"interest_coverage_ratio":17.65,"profit_before_tax":206450,"corporation_tax":39226,"effective_tax_rate_percent":19,"net_profit":167224,"net_margin_percent":13.43},"2021":{"revenue":1434750,"revenue_yoy_growth_percent":15.24,"cost_of_sales":215212,"gross_profit":1219538,"gross_margin_percent":85,"administrative_expenses":845700,"operating_profit":273613,"operating_margin_percent":19.07,"depreciation_amortisation":31200,"ebitda":304813,"interest_payable":8950,"interest_coverage_ratio":30.57,"profit_before_tax":264663,"corporation_tax":50286,"effective_tax_rate_percent":19,"net_profit":214377,"net_margin_percent":14.94},"2022":{"revenue":1649964,"revenue_yoy_growth_percent":15,"cost_of_sales":247494,"gross_profit":1402470,"gross_margin_percent":85,"administrative_expenses":936480,"operating_profit":350693,"operating_margin_percent":21.25,"depreciation_amortisation":34850,"ebitda":385543,"interest_payable":6200,"interest_coverage_ratio":56.56,"profit_before_tax":344493,"corporation_tax":65454,"effective_tax_rate_percent":19,"net_profit":279039,"net_margin_percent":16.91},"2023":{"revenue":1897458,"revenue_yoy_growth_percent":15,"cost_of_sales":284618,"gross_profit":1612840,"gross_margin_percent":85,"administrative_expenses":1078950,"operating_profit":401298,"operating_margin_percent":21.15,"depreciation_amortisation":38920,"ebitda":440218,"interest_payable":3850,"interest_coverage_ratio":104.23,"profit_before_tax":397448,"corporation_tax":75515,"eff