 service contracts rather than one-off high-margin installations."},"valuation":{"expert":"valuation","company_name":"DHA Fire","analysis_date":"2024-05-22","score":72,"confidence":"medium","ebitda_multiple_valuation":{"adjusted_ebitda_base":432566.54,"sector_multiple_range":{"low":2,"mid":3,"high":4},"selected_multiple":2.75,"multiple_justification":"A multiple of 2.75x is selected, sitting slightly below the sector midpoint. While the sector has strong regulatory tailwinds and the company shows high growth (17.6% in 2026), the valuation is tempered by extreme historical margin volatility, high owner dependency, and a heavy reliance on subcontractors which reduces the 'stickiness' of the service delivery model.","premium_factors_applied":["Strong revenue CAGR of 11.65%","Debt-free balance sheet","Excellent working capital management (32.5 debtor days)","Regulatory-driven non-discretionary sector"],"discount_factors_applied":["High owner dependency (single director)","Extreme margin volatility (29% to 49% Gross Margin)","High subcontractor spend (£744k) limiting direct control","Aggressive dividend extraction weakening capital base"],"enterprise_value_range":{"conservative":865133.08,"base":1189557.99,"optimistic":1513982.89}},"ev_to_equity_bridge":{"enterprise_value_base":1189557.99,"plus_cash":100000,"minus_long_term_debt":0,"minus_director_loans":0,"minus_bad_debt_provision":13500,"minus_working_capital_adjustment":0,"equity_value":{"conservative":951633.08,"base":1276057.99,"optimistic":1600482.89}},"asset_based_valuation":{"net_asset_value":192267,"property_adjustment":0,"bad_debt_adjustment":13500,"adjusted_nav":178767,"nav_as_floor":true},"revenue_multiple_crosscheck":{"latest_revenue":1790145.7,"revenue_multiple_range":{"low":0.4,"high":0.7},"implied_ev_range":{"low":716058.28,"high":1253101.99}},"valuation_summary":{"recommended_range":{"equity_value_low":950000,"equity_value_mid":1275000,"equity_value_high":1600000},"primary_methodology":"ebitda_multiple",