o make the offer more attractive to a seller anchoring on high Net Asset Value and growth history.","retention_escrow":50000,"escrow_release_conditions":"Released after 12 months."},"seller_obligations":{"handover_period_months":3,"non_compete_months":12,"non_compete_scope":"Direct solicitation of the Top 5 named clients.","consultancy_arrangement":"Ad-hoc as required."},"warranties_indemnities":{"specific_indemnities":["Standard title and capacity warranties.","Limited indemnity for existing litigation or known disputes."],"warranty_cap_percent":25,"warranty_period_months":12,"de_minimis":10000,"basket":50000},"completion_mechanism":{"type":"locked_box","working_capital_peg":750000,"rationale":"Speeds up the closing process in a competitive bidding environment."},"effective_price":{"best_case":1750000,"expected_case":1750000,"worst_case":1312500}}],"recommended_structure":"Balanced","recommendation_rationale":"The Balanced structure addresses the 'Critical' customer concentration risk through a 20% earnout while providing enough upfront cash (65%) to satisfy a seller who has built a stable, high-margin business. It also includes a specific indemnity for the technical team, which is the company's primary operational asset.","negotiation_priorities":["Validation of the 'Top 5' contract terms and renewal dates.","Agreement on the 'Replacement MD' salary deduction of £57.5k in the EBITDA calculation.","Securing long-term commitment from the 6-person Engineering & Technical team.","Establishing a clear Working Capital Peg to account for the high NWC intensity (21% of revenue)."],"deal_breaker_terms":["Loss of Baker Hughes or Halliburton contracts prior to completion.","Discovery of significant 'leakage' or undisclosed director drawings in the locked box period.","Refusal of the seller to provide a non-compete regarding the 5 core clients."],"key_findings":["The business is a high-quality 'boutique' with exceptional 40% margins but extreme concentration risk.","Asset bas