an 12% of revenue. From a debt-service perspective, the company is currently unleveraged and generates substantial EBITDA, providing significant headroom for acquisition financing. The only area requiring further due diligence is the sales ledger; trade debtors have increased by 116% year-on-year, which is disproportionate to revenue growth and may indicate a loosening of credit terms or collection delays. However, given the strong cash position of £455k and high current ratio, this does not currently pose a liquidity risk. Overall, the financial performance is indicative of a well-managed, highly profitable niche operator with strong cash flow characteristics."}	\N	88	high	10935	{"promptTokenCount":10612,"candidatesTokenCount":1717,"totalTokenCount":12329}	14	\N	2026-03-20 14:33:22.191443	2026-03-20 14:33:33.629
