quid and virtually debt-free, with an interest coverage ratio of 70.8x. The primary concern for a buyer is the aggressive extraction of capital; dividends have frequently matched or exceeded annual profits, which resulted in a decline in net assets between 2022 and 2024. However, the 2025 recovery in retained earnings suggests the business can support this level of extraction while maintaining a healthy cash buffer. Overall, the financial trajectory is accelerating, making it an attractive acquisition target with substantial capacity for leverage if required."}	\N	82	high	14210	{"promptTokenCount":46538,"candidatesTokenCount":2588,"totalTokenCount":49126}	17	\N	2026-03-21 19:36:09.31829	2026-03-21 19:36:24.003
