en B2B (property managers/insurers) and B2C (homeowners) revenue."],"narrative":"Hub Property Care operates in a resilient but fragmented UK sector. At £2.26M revenue, it has achieved a scale that makes it an attractive 'bolt-on' for larger regional players or a starting point for a private equity 'buy-and-build' strategy. However, as a trade-based service with 21 employees, it remains heavily dependent on human capital. To achieve a multiple at the higher end of the 2.0x-3.5x range, the buyer must verify that the revenue is not overly dependent on the founder's personal relationships and that there is a clear path to recurring, contracted income rather than one-off reactive repairs."}	\N	68	medium	8417	{"promptTokenCount":1548,"candidatesTokenCount":1475,"totalTokenCount":3023}	21	{financial}	2026-03-24 20:24:35.627126	2026-03-24 20:25:01.591
