rofit tracking Operating Profit closely, and the lack of significant exceptional items suggests a transparent and predictable financial performance."}	\N	82	high	13885	{"promptTokenCount":36276,"candidatesTokenCount":2198,"totalTokenCount":38474}	24	\N	2026-03-26 10:15:17.253853	2026-03-26 10:15:31.614
