vices & Telecoms sector, demonstrating robust financial health across all primary screening metrics. The company has achieved a consistent Revenue CAGR of 15.1% over the last five years, reaching 2.18m in FY2024. Profitability is a standout feature, with gross margins held steady at 85% and net margins expanding to 17.6%, indicating excellent operational efficiency and pricing power. The balance sheet is pristine; the company has eliminated all long-term debt and maintains a cash reserve of 1.06m, providing a current ratio of 4.6. Cash flow is genuine and closely aligned with reported profits. While there is moderate customer concentration among blue-chip financial institutions, the risk is balanced by a very clean aged debt profile (less than 1% over 90 days). The workforce is well-structured with a healthy revenue-per-employee of 91k and low director dependency. Given the zero-debt status, strong growth trajectory, and high-quality earnings, we recommend an immediate move to full due diligence."}	\N	\N	\N	10926	{"promptTokenCount":37752,"candidatesTokenCount":1601,"totalTokenCount":39353}	1	{data_quality}	2026-03-27 14:14:19.544983	2026-03-27 14:14:30.518
