:80,"deferred":100000,"deferred_schedule":"Paid at month 6.","earnout_maximum":150000,"earnout_metric":"Revenue Growth","earnout_period_months":12,"earnout_rationale":"Trigger 6 (Forecasted Growth): To validate the 2025 growth spurt is sustainable. Identified by Valuation expert.","retention_escrow":0,"escrow_release_conditions":"N/A"},"seller_obligations":{"handover_period_months":3,"non_compete_months":24,"non_compete_scope":"Direct competition in the UK creative sector.","consultancy_arrangement":"None required beyond handover."},"warranties_indemnities":{"specific_indemnities":["Tax warranties only"],"warranty_cap_percent":100,"warranty_period_months":12,"de_minimis":10000,"basket":25000},"completion_mechanism":{"type":"locked_box","working_capital_peg":null,"rationale":"Provides price certainty for the seller, suitable for a competitive process where the buyer has high confidence in the 2025 balance sheet."},"effective_price":{"best_case":1250000,"expected_case":1200000,"worst_case":950000}}],"recommended_structure":"Balanced","recommendation_rationale":"The Balanced structure addresses the significant valuation gap (£500k+) identified by the Valuation expert while providing the buyer with a mechanism to de-risk the 90% client concentration. It offers enough upfront cash to be attractive to the seller but uses an earnout to ensure the 'adjusted' EBITDA is actually delivered post-acquisition.","negotiation_priorities":["Agreement on the Working Capital Peg to address the 2024 deficit.","Validation of the Top 5 client contracts and their renewal dates.","Treatment of the £107k deferred tax liability in the equity bridge.","Defining 'Gross Profit' for earnout purposes to prevent accounting manipulation."],"deal_breaker_terms":["Refusal of a 12-month handover period by the directors.","Discovery of significant undisclosed bad debts in the £181k ledger.","Inability to secure key client consent for change of control."],"key_findings":["The business is high-growth but