ly profitable business that warrants a PROCEED recommendation. Revenue has grown from 168,287 to 658,137 in three years, maintaining a robust net margin of 29.9%. The balance sheet is exceptionally clean with no bank debt and a strong current ratio of 2.2. The primary risks are 'soft' assets: a large trade debtor balance and a significant director's loan account which together account for the majority of current assets. Furthermore, the lack of customer-level data and volatile headcount figures require specific investigation. If the debtor book is recoverable and the revenue is not overly concentrated, this represents a high-quality acquisition target."}	\N	\N	\N	10165	{"promptTokenCount":25862,"candidatesTokenCount":1538,"totalTokenCount":27400}	25	{data_quality}	2026-03-29 20:12:40.782139	2026-03-29 20:12:50.994
